{"id":"n32526-2-6","stage":2,"title":"기적 · 神迹","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n32526-2-6-1","ko":"왜 갑자기 신자가 되셨어요?","zh":"怎么突然成为信徒了呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"신자가","meaning":"信徒","explanation":"신자：信徒；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"신자","audio":"/audio/c6e0250ba2f1a4de2a21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91248","senseId":"1","lemma":"신자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되셨어요?","meaning":"成为，变为","explanation":"되다：成为，变为；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"1","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"c6e0250ba2f1a4de","term":"신자","zh":"信徒","audio":"/audio/c6e0250ba2f1a4de2a21.mp3","entryId":"91248","definition":"信奉宗教的人。","pronunciation":["신ː자"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"成为，变为","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"拥有新的身份或地位。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2682bd4a0e488023de91.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n32526-2-6-2","ko":"신께서 기적을 보여 주셨거든.","zh":"因为神显出了奇迹啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"신께서","meaning":"上帝，神","explanation":"신：上帝，神；께서：이/가 的敬语形式，标记受到尊敬的主语。","readings":[{"term":"신","audio":"/audio/e609f3d29b9f741ae96e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13993","senseId":"1","lemma":"신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기적을","meaning":"神迹","explanation":"기적：神迹；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"기적","audio":"/audio/9ad2e271b9070e45cc33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32526","senseId":"2","lemma":"기적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보여","meaning":"得到，受到","explanation":"보이다：得到，受到；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59531","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주셨거든.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e609f3d29b9f741a","term":"신","zh":"上帝，神","audio":"/audio/e609f3d29b9f741ae96e.mp3","entryId":"13993","definition":"宗教里被认为具有超人类及超自然能力，且能够左右人类命运的信仰对象。","pronunciation":["신"]},{"id":"9ad2e271b9070e45","term":"기적","zh":"神迹","audio":"/audio/9ad2e271b9070e45cc33.mp3","entryId":"32526","definition":"相信只有全知全能的神才能做出的神奇的事情。","pronunciation":["기적"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"得到，受到","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"59531","definition":"遭遇某事或得到某物。","pronunciation":["보이다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/58fe32111387c75841ce.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.55,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=32526","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecomm